ExceptionHandling

why custom exceptions?
can customize message and http status code according to exception

disadvantage of handling exception at endpoint level?
1. different endpoints having try-catch for handling same exception (lot of boilerplate code)

disadvantage of handling exception at controller level using @ExceptionHandler?
1. not accessible to other controller classes,
   have to write same exception handler method in each of them

advantage of handling exception at global level using @ControllerAdvice?
1. centralized exception handling for all controllers

Best practice for exception handling:
payload: clean and generic error response
logger: detailed technical information for debugging

Purpose of adding getter/setter in dto class?
when we return a java object from controller
spring uses Jackson to convert it into JSON
Jackson needs getters to read field values

